  <section class="why">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">Why YaadWine</p>
    <p class="why-text">Wine has always been a story of movement. Grapes crossed borders. People carried traditions across oceans. Cultures reshaped what was planted, produced, and poured.</p>
    <p class="why-text">YaadWine exists to explore those journeys — because understanding where wine came from means understanding the people who carried it forward.</p>
    <p class="why-text">History and celebration can sit at the same table.</p>
  </section>

